Factory template ("Foreman"), Copyright (c) 2026 Vercel, Inc., under the MIT
License. The full MIT licence text is in LICENSES/MIT-foreman.txt. Ported files
are listed in ATTRIBUTION.md.

It also follows design patterns (not code) from:
- LangChain open-swe (MIT): deterministic thread identity, follow-up messages
  during a run, CI babysitting caps, always ending in a pull request or a
  clear failure.
- github/gh-aw (MIT): the agent never holds a write token, deterministic code
  applies the patch and opens the draft pull request, and the patch is checked
  before it is published.
